1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780
This is Category Bet Desk, an independent concept for

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:05,507
Fleek's Special Projects Lead in Category Expansion.

3
00:00:05,507 --> 00:00:08,811
It uses public information only, and it is not a Fleek product.

4
00:00:08,803 --> 00:00:10,084
I'll pick the first bet:

5
00:00:10,084 --> 00:00:12,164
vintage sportswear and branded outdoor,

6
00:00:12,164 --> 00:00:14,512
measured against five million pounds of GMV.

7
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:18,252
The thesis card says who buys, who supplies, and why Fleek wins.

8
00:00:18,252 --> 00:00:20,294
Blue labels are sourced, and each one

9
00:00:20,294 --> 00:00:22,391
links to the public page it came from.

10
00:00:22,604 --> 00:00:24,349
Here is one ten-piece bundle.

11
00:00:24,349 --> 00:00:27,297
After freight, grading, payments and disputes, it

12
00:00:27,297 --> 00:00:29,704
contributes twenty-one pounds fifty-six.

13
00:00:29,923 --> 00:00:33,050
Drop the take rate from fifteen to twelve percent, and contribution

14
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:35,524
per bundle falls straight to seventeen pounds twelve.

15
00:00:35,995 --> 00:00:38,470
I'll put it back to fifteen before we move on.

16
00:00:38,684 --> 00:00:40,374
The ramp sells the lower of what

17
00:00:40,374 --> 00:00:42,222
suppliers list and what buyers buy.

18
00:00:42,222 --> 00:00:45,391
This bet reaches a five-million run-rate in month seventeen.

19
00:00:45,782 --> 00:00:48,654
The sensitivity table recalculates every cell live.

20
00:00:48,654 --> 00:00:50,682
Here, contribution per bundle as the

21
00:00:50,682 --> 00:00:52,484
take rate and dispute rate move.

22
00:00:52,699 --> 00:00:54,732
The gates are set before any pilot.

23
00:00:54,732 --> 00:00:57,927
With no measured readings yet, the scorecard says hold.

24
00:00:57,927 --> 00:01:00,018
Missing data never counts as a pass.

25
00:01:00,224 --> 00:01:04,071
Export bet memo gives one printable page for the decision meeting.

26
00:01:04,071 --> 00:01:06,227
Independent concept by Ayomide Ahmed.

